01:36:29.258 --> 01:36:32.035
purpose-built rental, uh, developers and builders.

01:36:32.453 --> 01:36:34.829
Uh, these are ready to go and to go in the market for rental.

01:36:35.760 --> 01:36:39.099
Okay. So that process, you're still waiting for that process then?

01:36:39.436 --> 01:36:43.226
100%. Um, I got signed site plan agreements.

